<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Our cost of revenue primarily
consists of the following components: (i)&nbsp;inventory costs, which primarily include procurement costs for chips, toner and OPC drums;
(ii)&nbsp;staff costs, which consist of salaries and benefits of production workers; (iii)&nbsp;depreciation expense relating to our plant,
property and equipment used for production; (iv)&nbsp;freight charges incurred by us for delivering products from our factories to our
warehouses abroad; (v)&nbsp;tariffs imposed on our products sold in the U.S.; and (vi)&nbsp;others, which primarily include overhead costs
relating to consumables and electricity used for production.</P>

